OL,3,GNEWSABudget savings urged to prepare
OL,4,Afor 'stormy' economy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA panel of economic experts has warned
OL,7,Fthat Jersey's government needs to make
OL,8,Fsavings on its budget, to stop it from
OL,9,Fusing its existing reserves to fund
OL,10,Fprojects.
OL,12,FThe Fiscal Policy Panel looks at the
OL,13,Fisland's finances, and makes
OL,14,Frecommendations to ministers and has
OL,15,Fwarned about preparing for "potentially
OL,16,Fstormy weather".
OL,18,FIn its latest report, it said that
OL,19,Fessential savings pots had been allowed
OL,20,Fto run down, and that they were not as
OL,21,Fsubstantial as they should be.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
